@page
@model PrivacyModel

<div class="container">

    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

    <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how DropZone collects, uses, and protects user data.
    </p>

    <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>
        We collect basic information such as seller names, contact numbers, and item records
        to operate the DropZone system effectively.
    </p>

    <h3>2. How We Use Data</h3>
    <p>
        Data is used only for managing item storage, tracking status, and improving system operations.
        We do not sell or share user data with third parties.
    </p>

    <h3>3. Data Protection</h3>
    <p>
        All information is stored in a secure database and accessed only by authorized users.
    </p>

    <h3>4. User Responsibility</h3>
    <p>
        Users are responsible for providing accurate information when adding sellers or items.
    </p>

    <h3>5. System Access</h3>
    <p>
        Access to the system is controlled through login authentication.
    </p>

    <h3>6. Updates</h3>
    <p>
        This policy may be updated when system features change.
    </p>

    <br />

    <a asp-page="/Index" class="btn">Back to Home</a>

</div>